Key Responsibilities

Conceive, design, engineer, & implement technology solutions on AEM platform by studying industry best practices;

Conferring with business users;

Studying requirements & processes & investigating problem areas;

Serve as the subject matter expert on AEM specifically & its integrations with various enterprise platforms;

Establish & ensure development & design standards across all AEM development teams on the platform in all areas around AEM & integration with other Adobe Marketing Cloud products &/or Enterprise platforms like – Salesforce CRM, SFMC, API Service Bus, SAML;

Participate & lead technical design discussions & provide detailed estimates to Product owners;

